type: software
title: "hologic-dxa-maps: Reproducible pipeline for Hologic DXA quantitative maps"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2024-01-01"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/mickaelbegon/hologic-dxa-maps"
authors:
  - family-names: Begon
    given-names: Mickael
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7854-4986"
    affiliation: "Université de Montréal"
keywords:
  - DXA
  - DICOM
  - Hologic
  - quantitative imaging
  - body composition
  - biomechanics
  - acrobatics
abstract: >
  A Python pipeline for extracting and reconstructing pixel-level quantitative
  maps of fat, lean tissue, and bone mineral content from Hologic DXA DICOM
  files. Designed for reproducible research in biomechanics and sports science,
  with strict separation between measured, calibrated, and experimental data.
